  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEm">III Em</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et nolo ut aliquis recipiat alterius hominem, priusquam quietus sit erga omnem manum quae rectum quaeret ab eo; et qui aliquem manutenebit et firmabit ad dampnum faciendum, custodiat, ut repraesentet eum ad emendandum, vel ipse componat quod alius componere debebat.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And it is my will that no-one receive [into his service] one who has been in the service of another man, until he be quit [of all charges preferred against him] from any quarter where justice is sought for him; and who shall support and harbour anyone who perpetrates crime shall see it that he bring him to make compensation, or shall himself pay what is due from the other.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
